And you'll never know until one of you says no.

00:26:42.660 --> 00:26:43.640
I would like to say it.

00:26:44.550 --> 00:26:45.250
Can you help me?

00:26:56.330 --> 00:26:57.450
The trail leads us here.

00:26:58.570 --> 00:26:59.550
Who dominates this place?

00:27:00.790 --> 00:27:01.150
An enemy.

00:27:03.510 --> 00:27:05.370
A man who only kills for pleasure.

00:27:07.130 --> 00:27:08.110
It's very dangerous.

00:27:08.430 --> 00:27:09.910
In that case, we'll attack tonight.

00:27:11.060 --> 00:27:11.880
if you attack 6

00:27:12.600 --> 00:27:13.400
we would have a war.

00:27:14.940 --> 00:27:17.100
Thurgan is allied with 22 tribes.

00:27:18.490 --> 00:27:20.130
And when he enters combat...

00:27:21.140 --> 00:27:22.440
never makes prisoners.

00:27:25.240 --> 00:27:26.080
Would I kill you all?

00:27:26.940 --> 00:27:27.200
Yes.

00:27:28.860 --> 00:27:30.000
If you could wait like this...

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:30.320
See you tomorrow.

00:27:32.040 --> 00:27:32.800
I would go there.

00:27:33.040 --> 00:27:34.380
I would propose a twerking.

00:27:35.340 --> 00:27:36.260
He will not be able to deny it.

00:27:38.120 --> 00:27:40.240
What will happen to the doctor if we wait until tomorrow?

00:27:43.430 --> 00:27:45.930
will try to possess his most recent acquisition.

00:27:48.070 --> 00:27:49.530
We will not allow that to happen.

00:27:52.580 --> 00:27:55.460
In our land, if a man wants a woman, she can refuse.

00:27:57.160 --> 00:27:58.480
No one rejects Thurgan.

00:28:00.160 --> 00:28:00.960
And it's still alive.

00:28:01.240 --> 00:28:05.220
We'll get in now.

00:28:05.380 --> 00:28:05.560
Stop!

00:28:09.250 --> 00:28:10.740
Don't follow us!

00:29:04.160 --> 00:29:06.900
I paid for her three hundred measures of gold.

00:29:08.380 --> 00:29:09.080
That's a lot.

00:29:09.260 --> 00:29:10.880
The price of ten women.

00:29:11.300 --> 00:29:14.620
What price should we pay to rescue her?

00:29:14.800 --> 00:29:18.740
We offer you three hundred and fifty measures of gold for the woman.

00:29:19.540 --> 00:29:22.750
She's very stubborn, but beautiful.

00:29:25.790 --> 00:29:26.870
A unique piece.

00:29:28.230 --> 00:29:28.630
Four hundred.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:44.600
maybe my wife will do it for all the devils 500 we will return it because that I have many young people

00:29:44.600 --> 00:29:51.720
who will give birth to many children as many as to form a tribe she is very important for our

00:29:51.720 --> 00:29:59.840
people she is not only a warrior but a shaman she knows the spirits of our land they tell her when the

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.920
When will the water run out?

00:30:02.390 --> 00:30:03.070
Those things.

00:30:03.170 --> 00:30:04.450
Do you think I'm an idiot?

00:30:04.790 --> 00:30:05.830
He's telling the truth.

00:30:06.400 --> 00:30:09.720
In the land of Ogada, women are like ours.

00:30:10.340 --> 00:30:11.020
A long time ago.

00:30:12.800 --> 00:30:13.740
But there's more.

00:30:14.410 --> 00:30:16.170
Carter is our boss.

00:30:16.810 --> 00:30:17.670
We need her.

00:30:20.830 --> 00:30:21.550
Get out.

00:30:22.030 --> 00:30:24.460
You have nothing that interests me.

00:30:25.840 --> 00:30:26.160
You think so?

00:31:11.550 --> 00:31:13.760
I've never felt so happy to see you.

00:31:14.180 --> 00:31:14.900
I think so.

00:31:15.740 --> 00:31:18.980
Do you remember that time in the P3X-595

00:31:18.980 --> 00:31:21.680
when you drank that and started to undress?

00:31:22.120 --> 00:31:23.760
Why don't we talk about something else?

00:31:24.570 --> 00:31:26.750
Mugal, I appreciate what you've done for me.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:30.700
We'll go at dawn.

00:31:34.370 --> 00:31:36.030
I don't blame him for what he did to you,

00:31:36.130 --> 00:31:38.080
as I don't blame him either.

00:31:38.260 --> 00:31:41.170
He has madness in his body,

00:31:41.370 --> 00:31:44.220
the same as when I was young.

00:31:47.740 --> 00:31:48.680
The madness of love.

00:32:20.380 --> 00:32:21.120
You have to help me.

00:32:21.180 --> 00:32:22.140
What happened, Inaya?

00:32:22.340 --> 00:32:25.180
He met with me, as the wind said he would.

00:32:25.920 --> 00:32:28.440
But before we could leave, his father took us.

00:32:28.600 --> 00:32:29.970
If you don't do it, I'll kill you.

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:32.340
Let's do something. They're going to kill her.

00:32:32.520 --> 00:32:47.580
It's all my fault. I should have let her marry Chimaca.

00:32:48.520 --> 00:32:50.040
I won't let my son get what he wants.

00:32:50.780 --> 00:32:52.660
Take him away, Chimaca.

00:32:52.880 --> 00:32:54.340
Can someone explain this to me?

00:32:54.360 --> 00:32:58.250
His own father ordered them to kill her, right?

00:32:58.610 --> 00:32:59.930
For violating the law.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:06.350
of his land durgan is obliged to make the law come true the more if it is about one of

00:33:06.350 --> 00:33:14.920
his must preach with the example we have to go back now negative we cannot go

00:33:14.920 --> 00:33:20.020
he is 17 years captain if we try to rescue that girl we could cause a war

00:33:20.020 --> 00:33:26.350
on this planet has become political colonel calm captain of free oppression

00:33:26.350 --> 00:33:29.350
free from oppression is the motto of the forces what it means

00:33:30.410 --> 00:33:32.200
It's their world, not ours.

00:33:32.520 --> 00:33:36.840
Do we have the right to interfere in their customs or change their laws?

00:33:37.120 --> 00:33:42.700
Yes, maybe men don't understand it, but they want to kill a girl simply because she's in love with this young man.

00:33:42.940 --> 00:33:46.310
I beg you, use your weapons, save her.

00:33:46.610 --> 00:33:49.360
The colonel is right.

00:33:49.620 --> 00:33:53.020
It would mean war, Abu.

00:33:53.200 --> 00:33:58.810
You must choose between a woman and me.

00:34:00.480 --> 00:34:04.360
I can't do it.

00:34:06.590 --> 00:34:07.650
Neither can I.

00:34:08.120 --> 00:34:11.100
Naya broke the law because of me, I can't abandon her to her fate.

00:34:11.550 --> 00:34:13.230
We must choose between one life or many.

00:34:13.570 --> 00:34:15.960
Wait, there must be another way.

00:34:16.340 --> 00:34:20.000
Mugal, in the old laws, won't there be something we can do?

00:34:20.080 --> 00:34:24.880
Yes, yes, if we fight with the law, Turgan will not wage war.

00:34:25.790 --> 00:34:28.550
Father, please, think, try to remember.

00:34:29.200 --> 00:34:29.980
There must be a way.

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:34.420
There is one.

00:35:01.310 --> 00:35:05.030
But not me.

00:35:34.160 --> 00:35:34.800
LAPIDATE HER!

00:35:40.570 --> 00:35:45.520
This does not concern you, Shabadai.

00:35:45.620 --> 00:35:48.710
A lynching can be imposed by another boss.

00:35:48.970 --> 00:35:50.010
There is no such law.

00:35:50.320 --> 00:35:51.140
Yes, there is.

00:35:51.420 --> 00:35:57.750
The song of Arkandir.

00:35:58.720 --> 00:35:59.680
The Fire Spirits.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:02.580
They will strengthen the arm of the righteous.

00:36:03.040 --> 00:36:04.890
I will never fight a coward.

00:36:05.600 --> 00:36:06.260
You are obliged.

00:36:06.660 --> 00:36:13.290
You overestimate my honor, assuming that I will consent to that murder.

00:36:14.300 --> 00:36:16.520
You would be defeated and my daughter would die anyway.

00:36:17.180 --> 00:36:21.600
So unless there is another boss to challenge my decision.

00:36:25.270 --> 00:36:26.030
I challenge you.

00:36:37.420 --> 00:36:40.430
Then fight. Now you have the opportunity to shut up forever.

00:36:40.790 --> 00:36:56.720
I will catch the wisdom of the spirits if I hear their voice.

00:37:01.720 --> 00:37:09.210
When you are cornered and there is no hope of a tomorrow, do not despair, and remember, the harder the fall will be, etc.

00:37:09.570 --> 00:37:11.110
You do not think I can win?

00:37:11.230 --> 00:37:14.890
None of that. I give for granted that at least you have notions of combat.

00:37:15.210 --> 00:37:16.290
Yes, level 3 advanced.

00:37:17.040 --> 00:37:17.940
You will do well.

00:37:30.150 --> 00:37:33.590
Just out of curiosity, how do spirits determine who wins?

00:37:37.160 --> 00:37:38.480
It's a fight to death.

00:37:39.270 --> 00:37:40.230
Thanks for watching!

00:37:42.340 --> 00:37:42.540
Death?

00:37:45.100 --> 00:37:45.180
and

00:37:49.770 --> 00:37:50.810
No one has talked about...

00:37:53.990 --> 00:37:54.230
Chillos

00:38:59.590 --> 00:38:59.890
It's my intention

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:02.360
You have won! I am free to go with Abu!

00:39:02.560 --> 00:39:03.880
I want to hear it from his lips.

00:39:04.140 --> 00:39:07.040
Free to leave.

00:39:07.700 --> 00:39:08.820
And the Shabadai?

00:39:08.980 --> 00:39:14.310
According to the law, there can be no war between our peoples.

00:39:14.630 --> 00:39:15.320
And me?

00:39:18.600 --> 00:39:18.840
And me?

00:39:19.220 --> 00:39:25.360
You have been free to leave.

00:39:45.830 --> 00:39:46.630
Will you come to the wedding?

00:39:47.240 --> 00:39:47.440
Ah!

00:39:47.660 --> 00:39:48.800
It's a six-day party.

00:39:50.310 --> 00:39:51.610
It will be better if we go back home.

00:39:52.680 --> 00:39:54.020
They are days of jubilation.

00:39:54.600 --> 00:39:59.360
We wish you and Naya many years of happiness and that you have many children.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:01.940
and also daughters.

00:40:02.200 --> 00:40:13.950
All the Sabadai be free!

00:40:25.040 --> 00:40:27.200
This will be our way to remember you.

00:40:43.500 --> 00:40:45.740
Do you think this new anesthesia will do miracles on Earth?

00:40:46.410 --> 00:40:48.490
If he does it, surely others will take all the credit.

00:40:49.350 --> 00:40:50.670
We will never be able to say his origin.

00:40:51.210 --> 00:40:53.830
Damn it, I'll have to say no to Oprah's interview.

00:40:54.790 --> 00:40:54.950
What?
